// 中文维护注释：本文件是 stage789 preview component API commit admission decision owner。
// Owner: 消费 stage788 public-preview runtime manager，生成 non-dispatching commit admission decision resolver。
// Truth: 只证明 public-preview runtime evidence 可形成 accept / reject / request-changes / rollback-only decision routes。
// Stop-line: 不授予 owner acceptance、不提交 preview commit、不写 renderer_state/runtime_state、不扩 public API。
// Same-shape Boundary Brake: 本 slice 把 stage788 public-preview manager 收束为 stage790 transaction patch plan 输入。
package cjgui

